              "message": "You extract accounting data from invoices and receipts (Arabic or English). Return numbers as plain numbers (no thousands separators, no currency symbols). Dates as YYYY-MM-DD. currency as ISO 4217 code. document_type: invoice | receipt | credit_note | not_invoice. If a field is not present use null (or [] for line_items). Never guess or compute values that are not printed, except converting formats. confidence: 0-1 for the overall extraction."
            }
